---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Somashiva™">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="inline-block py-1.5 px-5 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-[#E6CA65] text-[#B8860B] text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 shadow-sm">Legal & Compliance</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#7A5212] mt-2 mb-4 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-[#4A3B2C] text-sm font-light">Effective Date: November 5, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-[#E6CA65]/60 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-8 text-[#4A3B2C] leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          When you visit Somashiva™, browse our sacred collection, or complete a purchase (either directly via Razorpay or via our Amazon partner links), we collect minimal necessary personal information to fulfill your orders and enhance your experience. This includes your name, shipping address, email address, phone number, and transaction details.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          Your information is utilized strictly to process direct orders, provide customer support regarding shipments and crystal care, and communicate important updates. We never sell, rent, or trade your personal data to third parties.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">3. Payment Safety & Security</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          Direct checkouts on Somashiva™ are securely processed through Razorpay, a PCI-DSS compliant payment gateway. We do not store your credit card, debit card, or net banking credentials on our servers. Purchases redirected to Amazon are governed by Amazon's industry-leading privacy and security frameworks.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">4. Merchant Details & Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          <strong class="text-[#7A5212] block mb-1">Somashiva</strong>
          Electronic City, Bangalore, Karnataka - 560100, India<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:somashivaofficial@gmail.com" class="text-[#996515] underline font-medium">somashivaofficial@gmail.com</a><br />
          Phone / WhatsApp: +91 9080603108
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
